{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08488","headline":"鲁中送二从弟赴举之西京 · 李白","name":"鲁中送二从弟赴举之西京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁客向西笑，君门若梦中。\n霜凋逐臣发，日忆明光宫。\n复羡二龙去，才华冠世雄。\n平衢骋高足，逸翰凌长风。\n舞袖拂秋月，歌筵闻蚤鸿。\n送君日千里，良会何由同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}